### SSE 订阅管理 API 测试

### 1. 连接 SSE（浏览器中手动测试）
### 在浏览器控制台运行：
### const eventSource = new EventSource('http://127.0.0.1:9484/api/v1/sse/connect')
### eventSource.onmessage = (e) => console.log(e.data)

### 2. 获取所有客户端
GET http://127.0.0.1:9484/api/v1/sse/clients
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. 订阅路径（请先从上一步获取 client_id）
POST http://127.0.0.1:9484/api/v1/sse/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "your-client-id-here",
  "path": "D:\\EdgeDownload"
}

###

### 4. 获取客户端订阅列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:9484/api/v1/sse/subscriptions/your-client-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. 取消订阅
POST http://127.0.0.1:9484/api/v1/sse/unsubscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "your-client-id-here",
  "path": "D:\\EdgeDownload"
}

###

### 6. 测试文件系统变化监听
POST http://127.0.0.1:9484/api/v1/filesystem/watch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "D:\\EdgeDownload"
}

###

### 7. 停止文件系统监听
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:9484/api/v1/filesystem/watch?path=D:\EdgeDownload
Content-Type: application/json

###
